{
  "forge_script": 1,
  "name": "020_spline_profile_extruded",
  "description": "Cubic spline with poles (30,0),(30,20),(0,20),(0,0) closed by a line and extruded 10 mm. Area 360 mm2 by exact polynomial integration of the Bezier; bbox height max of y(t) = 60t(1-t) = 15; centroid y = 45/7 from -(1/A) * integral of y^2/2 dx along the curve (exact fractions)",
